{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.yuika.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "雨里的那条街",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.yuika.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.yuika.first",
    "idolId": "yuika",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（雨越下越大了……找个人少的地方躲一下吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（这家店的屋檐……应该淋不到。）",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "哇——！没人说今天会下雨啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "周边没淋湿吧？没事吧？我想想……",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（那个女孩子也在躲雨……）",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……嗯？哇，那个包，里面塞满了人气偶像的演唱会限定品……）",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "这边没事，这个也没事……！嗯，全都 OK！太好了——",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "啊，不好意思，吵到您了吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？啊，没有。没关系。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "那就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……她自己倒比包淋得更湿。手帕在哪儿呢——）",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊。你的徽章掉了哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "诶？啊，真的！不好意思，谢谢您！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "太好了……！这个是限定款，帮大忙了！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……笑得好开心啊。）",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（那么喜欢偶像，会为一个徽章高兴成这样……）",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……这个孩子的话，说不定——）",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个……不好意思，突然这么说你可能会困惑……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你对偶像……有兴趣吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "……诶？偶像？",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是的。我想让你去当偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "……呃，那个……这话题跳得也太突然了吧……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "……啊。这位大哥其实也是偶像宅？找到能聊的人所以很开心——这种感觉？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "还是说，这是委婉的搭讪？『做我一个人的偶像』，那种的。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是那样。我是这边的人——",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "283……制作公司？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我觉得你一定能成为很棒的偶像。怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "……啊、啊哈哈……这个玩笑，今天最好笑。其实你是搞笑艺人吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，我是认真的。我真的希望你能当偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "……我，当偶像……",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "也不是，我是说我很感兴趣……但是……诶？真的假的？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真的。能不能和我一起，以偶像为目标？",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "……既、既然您都说到这个份上了……",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "……三峰，结华。接下来，请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……她报名字的时候，停了一下。）"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
